  "details": "# Issue: \n\nWhen using the Dolly Camera with Streaming set to Multi remote users will only ever see the camera from the first / main camera path and not for all the other cameras / paths.\n\nThis can be a bit problematic when it comes to privacy etc.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nRemote users should see an indicator for all cameras on the different paths, maybe even use the camera indicator that's used for the dolly cam locally. \n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/xljUOTxJcBQ",
